% refs_merged.bib -- Degrees of Separation, merged and verified bibliography
%
% Built by a verification script kept outside the repo (revision 1 session scratchpad: lit/build_bib.py; that
% scratchpad copy no longer exists, so each entry's comment line is the record of how it was checked) from
% paper/refs.bib (12 entries) and refs/references.bib (47 entries): 53 distinct keys; 'collegescorecard' merged
% into 'scorecard' (same data source) -> 52 existing entries; plus 98 new entries for the literatures the
% referees said were missing (97 in revision 1; revision 2 added quadlin2021same by hand, checked against its
% Crossref record) -> 150; revision 4 (2026-09-24) added bloem2024understanding (DataCite) and muse2024college
% (Crossref) by hand, the closest US prior work on field-varying selectivity gradients in Scorecard data. Total 152.
%
% Verification (2026-09-23): every entry with a Crossref DOI was fetched from api.crossref.org/works/<doi> and
% its year (print year where Crossref has one), venue, volume, issue, first page, title and author surnames were
% compared with the entry; new entries were generated from the Crossref record and had to match the expected first
% author, year and title before being written. Entries without a Crossref record were checked against the
% publisher or registry (arXiv API, DataCite, IZA, Russell Sage Foundation, the data providers' pages); each
% entry's comment line says which. Details that could not be confirmed are listed at the end of this file.
% Re-verified 2026-09-24 with a fresh script (session scratchpad lit_fix3/verify_bib.py, also outside the repo):
% the 138 entries with a DOI were compared field by field with their registry record (136 Crossref, 2 DataCite:
% title similarity >= 0.90, print/issued year, journal or book title, volume, issue, first page, author surnames);
% 0 mismatches. The 12 entries without a DOI are hussain2009university, stiglitz1975theory, espeland2016engines
% and nine data/web/arXiv items (interdisc2025arxiv, jiang2024decoding, ncses_sdr, onet, orcid, pseo, qs_subject,
% scorecard, the_geurs). Strict pybtex 0.24.0 parse: 150 entries, no duplicate keys.
% Revision 4 re-ran the same script on the 152 entries (session scratchpad lit_fix4/verify_bib.py): 140 entries
% with a DOI (137 Crossref, 3 DataCite), 12 without; one flagged detail, muse2024college's first page (33 in the
% entry, from the publisher's page and PDF; Crossref stores only the article number 55), listed at the end.
% Keys of existing entries are unchanged (refs/notes/<key>.md and the .tex files use them), so a few keys carry
% a year that differs from the cited version (chetty2023diversifying -> QJE 2026; machado2022alumni -> JOLE 2025).
% Titles are brace-protected for plainnat sentence-casing (proper nouns, acronyms).
% Revision 5 (2026-09-25): the 18 entries of paper/refs_theory_pending.bib (model section) were merged as the
% section 'NEW: Reputation, status, revealed valuation and construct validity'; their verification comments are kept.

